Print version, commit, build date and the built in limits

Usage:
  onesie version [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help                    Show this help.
  -o, --output FORMAT           Print text, or under json the same as one JSON object.

Global Flags:
      --profile NAME            The profile a run uses, from profiles.json in the config
                                dir. Overrides ONESIE_PROFILE and ONESIE_PROVIDER.
                                Otherwise the default profile runs, which onesie profile
                                use sets.
      --provider PROVIDER       Run on this provider without a profile: typesafe,
                                openrouter, berget, levanto, cloudflare or vercel.
                                Overrides ONESIE_PROVIDER and the default profile.
                                Refused beside --profile or ONESIE_PROFILE.
